      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happened again tonight, I was in a group of around 7 friends in the world \"Poolside Paradise By Zilthus\" without any issues, but then after traveling through a portal to a new instance of \"Soft Sea By ~Camille\", everyone that went through the portal shortly started to hear each other from locations where they where not visibly being shown. One player that did not go through the portal, instead joining by a request after the portal disappeared for them, did not have the issue at first, but later experienced it a few minutes after it started for everyone else. Other late joins did not experience the issue(5 plus minutes after the instance was created). Restarting the game resolved the problem for whoever tried restarting, but just rejoining the world did not fix it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
